@startuml kairos-soul-capture-sequence
title Soul Capture and Follow-up

actor "Outreach Worker" as Worker
participant "Web Admin / Outreach UI" as UI
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Worker -> UI: Open Soul Capture Form
UI -> API: GET /outreach/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT outreach program
DB --> API: Program details
API --> UI: Program details

Worker -> UI: Enter soul details\nSubmit form
UI -> API: POST /outreach/{id}/souls
API -> DB: Insert Soul\n(name, contact, outreach_program_id,\n status="New")
DB --> API: New soulId
API --> UI: 201 Created

' Later: follow-up assignment
UI -> API: POST /souls/{soulId}/followups
API -> DB: Insert FollowUp\n(assigned_to, status="Pending")
DB --> API: FollowUpId
API --> UI: 201 Created

' Follow-up completion
UI -> API: PATCH /followups/{followUpId}\n{status="Completed", notes, nextStep}
API -> DB: Update FollowUp
DB --> API: OK
API --> UI: 200 OK

@enduml
